{"id":71267,"date":"2026-10-28T18:34:27","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T18:34:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71267"},"modified":"2026-10-28T19:36:21","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T18:36:21","slug":"sao-silvestre-gondomar","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-gondomar\/","title":{"rendered":"10\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Gondomar 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">10\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Gondomar 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>10\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Gondomar 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, iluminando o cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Gondomar<\/strong>, no distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>, com o ambiente festivo e as luzes de Natal que caracterizam esta cl\u00e1ssica noturna nortenha. Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o a partir das 17:00 e partidas e chegadas instaladas em frente aos Pa\u00e7os do Concelho, na <strong>Rua dos Combatentes da Primeira Grande Guerra<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Gondomar), o evento abre \u00e0s <strong>17:15<\/strong> com a <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre dos Pequenos (500 m)<\/strong> \u2014 onde os mini-atletas correm com bast\u00f5es luminosos a evocar as tradicionais tochas acesas \u2014, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> o tiro de partida para a prova principal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (com tempo limite de 2 horas e escal\u00f5es de Seniores a Veteranos 65+) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 4 km<\/strong> de cariz l\u00fadico e familiar, animada por adere\u00e7os de n\u00e9on e pelo apoio popular ao longo das art\u00e9rias da capital da filigrana. O tra\u00e7ado urbano percorre pontos emblem\u00e1ticos da cidade, passando pela <strong>Avenida Oliveira Martins<\/strong>, <strong>Largo de Santo Ant\u00f3nio (Souto)<\/strong>, <strong>Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong>, rotunda do <strong>Monumento ao Bombeiro Volunt\u00e1rio<\/strong>, <strong>Rua D. Jo\u00e3o de Fran\u00e7a<\/strong> e <strong>Rua do Monte do Crasto<\/strong>, antes do regresso triunfal \u00e0 meta diante do edif\u00edcio aut\u00e1rquico.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada conjuntamente pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Comvidacorrer e Munic\u00edpio de Gondomar<\/strong>, com arbitragem e cronometragem oficial do Conselho Regional de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto, a prova garante a todos os participantes t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o e seguro desportivo, tendo na campe\u00e3 ol\u00edmpica Fernanda Ribeiro uma das grandes refer\u00eancias associadas ao historial da corrida. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Gondomar (Rua dos Combatentes da Grande Guerra), Gondomar, Por